      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "진짜요!?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C4C9DCC6940021003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "축하드려요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD95D558B4DCB824C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서, 다음은 연애 소설을 써 볼 생각인데,\n이번에도 도와줄 수 있겠니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C002C0020B2E4C74CC7400020C5F0C5600020C18CC124C7440020C3680020BCFC0020C0DDAC01C778B370002C000AC774BC88C5D0B3C40020B3C4C640C9040020C2180020C788ACA0B2C8003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구체적으로는 지금부터 말하는 포켓몬들을\n지닌 포켓몬에 넣고 보여 줬으면 한단다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CCCB4C801C73CB85CB2940020C9C0AE08BD80D1300020B9D0D558B2940020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C744000AC9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE00020BCF4C5EC0020C92CC73CBA740020D55CB2E8B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "첫 번째, 페어리타입 포켓몬.\n두 번째, 드래곤타입 포켓몬.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n세 번째, 우두머리 포켓몬.\n네 번째, 우두머리 포켓몬.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CCAB0020BC88C9F8002C0020D398C5B4B9ACD0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAAC002E000AB4500020BC88C9F8002C0020B4DCB798ACE4D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAAC002E00100001BE01000AC1380020BC88C9F8002C0020C6B0B450BA38B9AC0020D3ECCF13BAAC002E000AB1240020BC88C9F8002C0020C6B0B450BA38B9AC0020D3ECCF13BAAC002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 부탁하마.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n몇 번이든 설명해 줄 테니\n지닌 포켓몬에 넣고 데려와 주렴.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
