      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 좋아했다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200030010000219000001000A001000020102000400100002190000020020C88BC544D588B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 좋아했다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200040010000219000001000A001000020102000500100002190000020020C88BC544D588B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 좋아했다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACACE0002000100002010200050010000219000001000A001000020102000200100002190000020020C88BC544D588B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "돌고 도는 사랑의 윤무!\n이런 이야기인데, 어떨 것 같니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3CCACE00020B3C4B2940020C0ACB791C7580020C724BB340021000AC774B7F00020C774C57CAE30C778B370002C0020C5B4B5A80020AC830020AC19B2C8003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋은데요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC740B370C694002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "진심이세요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C4C2ECC774C138C694003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 잠깐! 방금 거는\n결말을 내기 까다로우니 안 되겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020C7A0AE5000210020BC29AE080020AC70B294000AACB0B9D0C7440020B0B4AE300020AE4CB2E4B85CC6B0B2C80020C5480020B418ACA0C5B4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다른 안이 하나 더 있단다.\n조금 길지만 괜찮다면 들어 보겠니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B9780020C548C7740020D558B0980020B3540020C788B2E8B2E4002E000AC870AE080020AE38C9C0B9CC0020AD1CCC2EB2E4BA740020B4E4C5B40020BCF4ACA0B2C8003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "들려주세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4E4B824C8FCC138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 안 들을래요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020C5480020B4E4C744B798C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬만 보여 주고 가 버리면\n내가 뭐가 되니.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACB9CC0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCACE00020AC000020BC84B9ACBA74000AB0B4AC000020BB50AC000020B418B2C8002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 시작하마.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C2DCC791D558B9C8002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르에는 두 개의 격투 유파가 있었다...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C5D0B2940020B4500020AC1CC7580020ACA9D22C0020C720D30CAC000020C788C5C8B2E4002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하나는 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 시조로 삼으며\n견고한 기술을 중시하는, <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>파.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558B098B2940020001000020102000400100002190000020020C2DCC870B85C0020C0BCC73CBA70000AACACACE0D55C0020AE30C220C7440020C911C2DCD558B294002C002000100002018B0001D30C002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다른 하나는 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0002> 시조로 삼으며\n유연한 기술을 중시하는, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>단.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B9780020D558B098B2940020001000020102000500100002190000020020C2DCC870B85C0020C0BCC73CBA70000AC720C5F0D55C0020AE30C220C7440020C911C2DCD558B294002C00200010000201000000B2E8002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강함을 추구하는 두 유파는 서로 간에\n시합 이외의 일로 만나는 것을 금지했다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D568C7440020CD94AD6CD558B2940020B4500020C720D30CB2940020C11CB85C0020AC04C5D0000AC2DCD5690020C774C678C7580020C77CB85C0020B9CCB098B2940020AC83C7440020AE08C9C0D588B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이를 어기면 <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>파와 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>단의\n모든 포켓몬을 적으로 만들게 된다는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n너무나도 엄격한 규칙이 있었기 때문이다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B97C0020C5B4AE30BA74002000100002018B0001D30CC64000200010000201000000B2E8C758000ABAA8B4E00020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C801C73CB85C0020B9CCB4E4AC8C0020B41CB2E4B29400100001BE00000AB108BB34B098B3C40020C5C4ACA9D55C0020ADDCCE59C7740020C788C5C8AE300020B54CBB38C774B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어느 날, <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>파의 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0004>\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>단의 <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001><U+0010><U+0001>븀\n각 유파의 대표가 되어, 두 유파 중 어느 쪽이<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n더 강한지를 정하는 싸움에 나서게 됐다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 24,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "패배한 유파는 해산하게 되는 승부...\n그러나, 대표로 나선 둘에게는 문제가 있었다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 4052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D328BC30D55C0020C720D30CB2940020D574C0B0D558AC8C0020B418B2940020C2B9BD80002E002E002E000AADF8B7ECB098002C0020B300D45CB85C0020B098C1200020B458C5D0AC8CB2940020BB38C81CAC000020C788C5C8B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0004> <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n서로 사랑하는 사이...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n시합 이외의 일로는 만나선 안 된다는\n규칙을 어겼던 것이다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200020010000219000004002000100002010200030010000219000001000AC11CB85C0020C0ACB791D558B2940020C0ACC774002E002E002E00100001BE01000AC2DCD5690020C774C678C7580020C77CB85CB2940020B9CCB098C1200020C5480020B41CB2E4B294000AADDCCE59C7440020C5B4ACBCB3580020AC83C774B2E4002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시합 전날 밤...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 4304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCD5690020C804B0A00020BC24002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0004> <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n눈을 마주치자마자 달리기 시작했다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 4336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010200020010000219000004002000100002010200030010000219000001000AB208C7440020B9C8C8FCCE58C790B9C8C7900020B2ECB9ACAE300020C2DCC791D588B2E4002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "죽음을 각오로 한\n사랑의 도피를 시작한 것이었다...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 4420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8FDC74CC7440020AC01C624B85C0020D55C000AC0ACB791C7580020B3C4D53CB97C0020C2DCC791D55C0020AC83C774C5C8B2E4002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 연애 경험이 별로 없어서\n연애 묘사가 빈약한 건 어쩔 수 없다만,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n멋진 스토리가 될 것 같지 않니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 4488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020C5F0C5600020ACBDD5D8C7740020BCC4B85C0020C5C6C5B4C11C000AC5F0C5600020BB18C0ACAC000020BE48C57DD55C0020AC740020C5B4CA540020C2180020C5C6B2E4B9CC002C00100001BE00000ABA4BC9C40020C2A4D1A0B9ACAC000020B4200020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AB2C8003F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럴 것 같아요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 4620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F40020AC830020AC19C544C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럴 것 같네요...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 4640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F40020AC830020AC19B124C694002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋았어! 완성시켜서\n미르 출판에 가져가야지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC558C5B400210020C644C131C2DCCF1CC11C000ABBF8B9740020CD9CD310C5D00020AC00C838AC00C57CC9C0002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도와줘서 정말 고맙다!\n잘되면 다음에 또 부탁하마!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4C640C918C11C0020C815B9D00020ACE0B9D9B2E40021000AC798B418BA740020B2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020BD80D0C1D558B9C8002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    }
